  "description": "A Coast Guard Air Station Kodiak MH-65 helicopter crew, forward deployed on the USCGC Stratton (WMSL 752), medevacs a 59-year-old man from the fishing vessel Golden Alaska approximately 40 miles northwest of Cold Bay, Alaska, March 29, 2018. The aircrew hoisted the man and safely transported him to LifeMed emergency medical personnel in Cold Bay for further care in Anchorage. U.S. Coast Guard video by USCGC Stratton unmanned aircraft system.",
